UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfallfestineveredysquare26shabrow22403-20261024@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261025T141409Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
SUMMARY:Fall Fest in Everedy Square & Shab Row
DESCRIPTION:Fall Fest 2026 at Everedy Square & Shab Row Celebrate the season at Fall Fest 2026\, a two-day autumn celebration in Everedy Square & Shab Row in Downtown Frederick on October 24-25. Spend the weekend exploring one of Frederick's most charming districts while enjoying seasonal food and drinks\, family-friendly activities\, local shopping\, and festive fall experiences. Browse unique offerings from local businesses\, artisans\, and makers\, discover seasonal treats\, and enjoy activities designed for visitors of all ages. Whether you're planning a family outing\, a day of shopping with friends\, or simply looking for a fun way to welcome the season\, Fall Fest offers something for everyone. Event Highlights: - Seasonal food\, beverages\, and local flavors - Family-friendly fall activities - Shopping from local retailers\, artisans\, and makers - Festive experiences throughout Everedy Square and Shab Row - Two full days of autumn fun in Downtown Frederick Join us October 24-25 and experience the sights\, flavors\, and spirit of fall in Downtown Frederick.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/fall-fest-in-everedy-square-%26-shab-row/22403/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventcowfest24036-20261025@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261025T141409Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
SUMMARY:Cowfest
DESCRIPTION:The Flying Cows are back with our 2nd Annual COWFEST\, presented by The Maryland Farm Bureau! This year we’re setting our sights on a world record — the most people dressed in cow onesies at one time. Last year we came incredibly close with 1\,048 participants\, and this year we’re going all the way! What is COWFEST? COWFEST\, presented by The Maryland Farm Bureau\, is the Frederick Flying Cows’ one-day family and fan fun festival — a celebration of all things Frederick\, community\, and of course… COWS! Held at The Great Frederick Fairgrounds\, this all-ages event features: A Helicopter Candy Drop\, Live Moo-sic The Junior Flyer Kid Zone Live Cow Petting & Cuddling LOT of Live Animals Local businesses + Vendors Moo & Brew Beer Garden Food Trucks + Sweet Treats Games\, Activities\, Giveaways Flying Cows Pro Players & Coaches LOTS of Cow Onesies — and much MOO-re! The Frederick Flying Cows and our partners are excited to continue the event for Year 2 and continue to build a new community tradition for Frederick families and fans! Tickets are required to enter the event. All listed prices do not include additional taxes and fees. All sales are final. No refunds\, exchanges\, or transfers will be issued for any reason. This is a rain or shine event.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/cowfest/24036/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
