SUMMARY:Drag Bingo: Ghoulish Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Come have a hauntingly ghoul time with drag talent and bingo! This Halloween Themed BINGO is not to miss! Come haunt at Steinhardt brewery with us and win up to $2\,800 in cash prizes! DRAG BINGO: Ghoulish Gallery! DRAG BINGO IS BACK with an event! Play bingo with your friends\, witness the very best drag performances from our stellar and fabulous queens\, and join our costume contest. Get the chance to WIN BIG\, while drinking and eating all that Steinhardt Brewing has to offer! This is by far the best way to support your local community center AND enjoy your Sunday. Featuring Kings and Queen of grave talent! $2\,800 in cash prizes with door prizes\, pull tabs for instant cash! All proceeds from this event go to benefit The Frederick Center\, a 501c-3 nonprofit dedicated to serving the LGBTQ+ community of the greater Frederick area.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/drag-bingo%3a-ghoulish-gallery/25944/
END:VEVENT
