BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventgroundedconnection3asomaticsinnaturewithalexawhite26000-20261025@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261025T141409Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
SUMMARY:Grounded Connection: Somatics in Nature with Alexa White
DESCRIPTION:Our time spent together will invite spaciousness and curiosity. We will tune into our senses\, learn and practice somatic safety exercises\, and deepen relationship with Earth community. The breadth of invitations will include body-based somatic safety practices that you can do anywhere\, landscape-based somatic safety practices that tend the nervous system in relationship with Earth\, mindfulness practices\, and meditations. Access information: walking on uneven surfaces\, up to a mile in distance\, and potential exposure to stinging & biting insects and ticks and plants that could cause skin irritation and disease. Meditation\, mindfulness\, and somatic safety & containment exercises can be activating depending on your body’s experience. All practices are optional and we will review how to listen to our bodies’ yes’s and no’s.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/grounded-connection%3a-somatics-in-nature-with-alexa-white/26000/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventjumbospumpkinpatchfallfestival11483-20261025@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261025T141409Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
SUMMARY:Jumbo's Pumpkin Patch Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with a full day of festive fun for all ages at Jumbo’s Pumpkin Patch! From classic farm adventures to fall-themed attractions\, our Fall Fun Festival is the perfect weekend outing for families\, friends\, and pumpkin lovers. What’s Included with Admission: Your ticket includes unlimited access to a variety of seasonal attractions: Hayrides through the farm 30+ acre u-pick pumpkin patch (pumpkins sold by the pound) Corn maze (14 acres) Petting zoo Jumping pillow Giant slides Mini mazes for younger guests Playgrounds and yard games General Store with fall shopping and décor​ Optional Add-Ons: (Available for Purchase Onsite - Saturday and Sunday Only) Enhance your day with these fun extras: Pony Rides – $7 Face Painting – $4 Sandy Candy (Edible Sand Art) – $4 Corn Cannon – $5 (3 shots) ​ Food & Drinks: Come hungry! A variety of food\, snacks\, and beverages are available for purchase\, including selections from Liquidity Ale Works of Mt. Airy. Tickets available online or at the gate.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/jumbos-pumpkin-patch-fall-festival/11483/
END:VEVENT
